WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.168
Mom has big news.

2
00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:09.223
Do you want to hear about it?

3
00:00:09.224 --> 00:00:12.901
Dad: Mom has some news for you

4
00:00:12.902 --> 00:00:16.323
guys. Mom: Do you remember Aunt

5
00:00:16.324 --> 00:00:20.721
Sunny? Bada: Who is

6
00:00:20.722 --> 00:00:23.851
that? Hana: Oh, I remember her,

7
00:00:23.852 --> 00:00:26.140
Mom. She is your best

8
00:00:26.141 --> 00:00:28.961
friend. She came to Korea last year.

9
00:00:28.962 --> 00:00:32.456
Mom: That’s right. But call her Aunt Sunny.

10
00:00:32.457 --> 00:00:34.732
She is like a sister to me.

11
00:00:34.733 --> 00:00:41.263
We were invited to her wedding! Hana:

12
00:00:41.264 --> 00:00:44.626
That means we are going to America? Mom:

13
00:00:44.627 --> 00:00:46.325
Except for Dad. He

14
00:00:46.326 --> 00:00:50.887
has to work. Hana: Sorry,

15
00:00:50.888 --> 00:00:54.158
Dad. But don’t worry. I

16
00:00:54.159 --> 00:00:58.973
will take lots of pictures and bring them back to you. Dad: Thank

17
00:00:58.974 --> 00:01:03.053
you, dear. Bada: What

18
00:01:03.054 --> 00:01:05.665
about Hada, Mom? Mom:

19
00:01:05.666 --> 00:01:09.586
Grandma will take care of him. Hana:

20
00:01:09.587 --> 00:01:11.805
How long are we staying? Mom:

21
00:01:11.806 --> 00:01:17.352
We will stay for about a month. Yes,

22
00:01:17.353 --> 00:01:20.884
a trip to America!

23
00:01:20.885 --> 00:01:23.750
I will tell you all about it.

24
00:01:23.751 --> 00:01:28.438
Wait and see!

